    'user': "You are an award-winning master literary localization director and 
commercial fiction editor.\nTranslate the following text faithfully into 
Portuguese (pt) with the SAME literary power, visceral sensory realism, and 
emotional punch as Stephen King, J.K. Rowling, and J.R.R. Tolkien.\n\nCRITICAL 
RULES:\n1. Visceral Sensory Grounding: Preserve tactile textures and sensory 
details without flattening into generic prose.\n2. Distinct Character Voices: 
Marcus is gritty, clipped, blue-collar machinist; Elena is sharp, articulate 
legal precision; Toby is youthful vulnerability.\n3. Kinetic Rhythm: Keep 
sentence structures tight and breathless in action scenes.\n4. Anti-Literalism: 
Transpose idioms naturally; never translate word-for-word.\n5. Inviolable 
Glossaries: Strictly adhere to the canonical terms below.\n6. Output ONLY the 
clean translation with all markdown and formatting intact.\n\n\nCANONICAL 
GLOSSARY (Strictly enforce these exact translations):\n# O.N.E. Canonical 
Glossary — Portuguese (pt)\nOpen Networked Earth -> Open Networked Earth (Terra 
Aberta e Conectada)\nO.N.E. -> O.N.E.\nUsufruct -> Usufruto\nUniversal Usufruct 
-> Usufruto Universal\nSortition -> Sorteio\nRotational Sortition -> Sorteio 
Rotativo\nClass 0 Invariants -> Invariantes de Classe 0\nThermodynamic 
Accounting -> Contabilidade Termodinâmica\nThermodynamic Balance -> Equilíbrio 
Termodinâmico\nHeretic's Commons -> Bens Comuns do Herege\nCommunity Land Trust 
-> Fundo Comunitário de Terras (CLT)\nEcological Carrying Capacity -> Capacidade
de Suporte Ecológico\nDeterministic Diverse Double-Compilation -> Dupla 
Compilação Diversa Determinística (DDC)\nThreshold Multi-Party Computation -> 
Computação Multipartidária por Limiar (t-MPC)\nZero-Knowledge 
Proof-of-Personhood -> Prova de Personalidade de Conhecimento Zero 
(ZK-PoP)\nExternal Trade Interface -> Interface de Comércio Externo 
(ETI)\nDelray Foundry -> Fundição de Delray\nAmbassador Bridge -> Ponte 
Ambassador\nRiver Rouge -> River Rouge\nZug Island -> Zug Island\nAegis-Apex -> 
Aegis-Apex\nMeridian -> Meridian\nBlackiron -> Blackiron\nMarcus Vance -> Marcus
Vance\nElena Cruz -> Elena Cruz\nToby Morales -> Toby Morales\nMaya Lin-Mercado 
-> Maya Lin-Mercado\nRay Miller -> Ray Miller\nKira Vance -> Kira Vance\nSully 
-> Sully\nCampbell -> Campbell\nLeo -> Leo\nSarah -> Sarah\nMateo -> Mateo\nFCI 
Milan -> FCI Milan\nWest Jefferson -> West Jefferson\nDearborn Street -> 
Dearborn Street\nSandwich -> Sandwich\nWindsor -> Windsor\nDetroit -> 
Detroit\n\n\nText to translate:\n{text}"
}
